      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im working on a sociology paper for class. the prompt is \"the myth of meritocracy: how it reinforces systemic inequality\". can u help me write a really strong, punchy intro that argues against meritocracy and makes the case that we need wealth redistribution to fix the imbalance?",
